## 10. WHAT NOT TO DO

- ❌ Do not add `pages/` directory entries.
- ❌ Do not use CSS-in-JS runtime libraries (styled-components, Emotion).
- ❌ Do not install a state-management library (Redux, Zustand, Jotai). Use React Context.
- ❌ Do not expose `RESEND_API_KEY` or other secrets to the client bundle.
- ❌ Do not use raw `<img>` tags.
- ❌ Do not add `"use client"` to layout or page files without a strong reason.
- ❌ Do not touch `components/ui/` files unless patching a specific shadcn bug.
